"{\"reasoning\":\"INFEASIBLE: To meet GBW 100\u202fMHz with CL=5\u202fpF requires gm\u22483.14\u202fmS. With the power budget (\u2264100\u202f\u00b5W) the total tail current \u226415\u202f\u00b5A, giving Id per input \u22647.5\u202f\u00b5A. Even at the highest allowed gm/Id (24\u202fV\u207b\u00b9) the maximum gm per input is 7.5\u202f\u00b5A\u00b724\u2248180\u202f\u00b5S, far below the needed 3.14\u202fmS. Thus the GBW, gain, and power specifications cannot be satisfied simultaneously with this 5\u2011transistor OTA in GF180MCU.\",\"gmid1\":24,\"L1_um\":0.28,\"gmid3\":24,\"L3_um\":0.28,\"gmid5\":24,\"L5_um\":0.28,\"Itail_uA\":15}"